  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, the equation has a real root<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Putting&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;in the first equation, we get,<br /><math><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>r</mi></math> which is the required condition.",
